## Hook Analysis
<!-- HOOK_START -->
**Hook Type:** Contrarian
**Analysis:** The hook leads with a provocative claim from Andrew Ng that challenges the current consensus around prompting as a viable AI technique, stating it will be 'dead in 6 months' and positioning graphs as the replacement. This directly contradicts what many in the AI community currently believe about prompting's importance.
